{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cg-api-v1-collection",
    "name": "Charging Guru API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Charging Guru EV platform.\n\n## Quick start\n1. Import this file **and** `charging-guru-local.postman_environment.json`\n2. Select the **Charging Guru — Local** environment\n3. Run **Auth → OTP Request** then **Auth → OTP Verify** — `access_token` is saved automatically\n4. All subsequent requests use `{{access_token}}` — no manual copy-paste needed\n\n## Auto-chaining\nTest scripts in each response automatically save IDs to collection variables:\n- `access_token`, `refresh_token` — set by OTP Verify\n- `station_id`, `charger_id` — set by Station Discovery\n- `booking_id` — set by Create Booking\n- `razorpay_order_id` — set by Create Payment Order\n- `qr_token` — set by Verify Payment\n\n## Roles\n- **User** flow: Auth → Discovery → Slots → Create Booking → Payment → (owner scans QR)\n- **Owner** flow: Auth with owner phone → Charger Status / QR Verify / Session Start+Complete\n- **Admin** flow: Auth with admin phone → Admin endpoints",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",           "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token",       "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refresh_token",      "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "request_id",         "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "debug_code",         "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "station_id",         "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "charger_id",         "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "booking_id",         "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "slot_start",         "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "razorpay_order_id",  "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "qr_token",           "value": "",                      "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "🏥 Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/live", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["health","live"] }
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }]
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/ready", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["health","ready"] }
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "description": "OTP-based phone authentication. Run in order: OTP Request → OTP Verify. access_token is saved automatically.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. OTP Request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"+919876543210\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/otp/request", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","otp","request"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                "var r = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('request_id', r.request_id);",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('debug_code', r.debug_code || '');",
                "console.log('OTP request_id:', r.request_id);",
                "if (r.debug_code) console.log('OTP code (DEV):', r.debug_code);"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. OTP Verify",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"request_id\": \"{{request_id}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{debug_code}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","otp","verify"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                "var r = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token',  r.access_token  || '');",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', r.refresh_token || '');",
                "pm.test('access_token received', () => pm.expect(r.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                "console.log('✅ Logged in. access_token saved.');"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","refresh"] }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                "var r = pm.response.json();",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token',  r.access_token  || '');",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', r.refresh_token || '');"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","logout"] }
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "exec": ["pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"], "type": "text/javascript" } }]
        }
      ]
    },

